AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0000205 "Obsoleted 2026-09-22. The term was added by hand on 2026-04-30 alongside an isSubCohortOf axiom on COHO:0000193 TwinGene Study, as the registry that study draws on; no source list or EBI database names a TwinGene Registry (the GWAS Catalog tags are TwinGene and TWINGENE, both COHO:0000193), and TwinGene is a sub-study of the Swedish Twin Registry, COHO:0000160. Replaced by COHO:0000193, which it duplicates by name; consider COHO:0000160 for the registry."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:consider coho:COHO_0000205 coho:COHO_0000160)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label coho:COHO_0000205 "obsolete TwinGene Registry"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated coho:COHO_0000205 "true"^^xsd:boolean)


